World was developed with AI assistance for nenelson1981-ctrl as a modern
replacement inspired by PeerGuardian Linux. World is not an official
PeerGuardian release and does not include the pgld daemon. No claim of
ownership over upstream PeerGuardian code or third-party data is made.

The globe artwork was generated specifically for World. The generator is
included in tools/generate-icons.py; its output matches the original icons.

Blocklist data is downloaded separately and remains subject to its providers'
terms. World does not grant rights to those lists. System dependencies are
installed separately and retain their own licenses.
